{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.2"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-017",
    "title": "顾氏旧印"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_088",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "“谁决定的？”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "青铜门之后没有道路。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2695,
          "end": 2695
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临跨进去时，脚下先是一空，随后踩在冰冷的石面上。雾气从膝下漫过，顾长离和叶观澜紧跟着进来。黑衣人没有追，他们停在门外，像是知道门内的规则不允许更多人同行。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2697,
          "end": 2697
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门在身后合拢。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2699,
          "end": 2699
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "雾气很快散开，露出一条宽阔的青石街。街两侧立着三层高的石楼，窗户全部封死，楼顶悬着断裂的铜管。铜管中没有水，却不时传出灵力流动的低鸣。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2701,
          "end": 2701
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“灵脉城。”叶观澜说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2703,
          "end": 2703
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这里还有人住？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2705,
          "end": 2705
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“曾经有。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2707,
          "end": 2707
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "街心立着一座石碑，碑面只写着城名，落款处却被整块削平。顾长离走到碑后，发现一排浅孔，孔距与顾氏账房常用的铜钉一致。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2709,
          "end": 2709
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封存工程的标记。”她说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2711,
          "end": 2711
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你确定？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2713,
          "end": 2713
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我小时候见过同样的孔。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2715,
          "end": 2715
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜看她：“顾家告诉过你什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2717,
          "end": 2717
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他们说祖辈修过一座废城。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2719,
          "end": 2719
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“只说了修城？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2721,
          "end": 2721
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“还说城里没有死人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2723,
          "end": 2723
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向紧闭的石楼。每一扇窗后都垂着黑布，黑布上布满细小的白点，像有人从里面用指甲反复刮过。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2725,
          "end": 2725
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "街尽头有一座拱门。拱门上方悬着一盏完整的灯，灯芯点燃，火焰却是青色。火光照着门额上的四个字：归墟灵城。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2727,
          "end": 2727
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不要看太久。”叶观澜提醒。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2729,
          "end": 2729
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“看灯会怎样？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2731,
          "end": 2731
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“会想起你不属于这里的部分。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2733,
          "end": 2733
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临移开目光，掌心残印仍然发热。青灯下方刻着一行小字：第二枚残印，封于城心。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2735,
          "end": 2735
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离走近一步：“这行字是新刻的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2737,
          "end": 2737
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你怎么看出来？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2739,
          "end": 2739
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“刀痕没有积灰。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2741,
          "end": 2741
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜没有否认：“有人希望我们来。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2743,
          "end": 2743
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "城中忽然传来铃声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2745,
          "end": 2745
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "不是钟，也不是灯罩碰撞，而是一串细小的铜铃从远处依次响起。街上的石楼同时打开一扇窗，黑布被风卷起，露出一张张苍白的脸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2747,
          "end": 2747
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看见那些脸没有五官。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2749,
          "end": 2749
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“活人？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2751,
          "end": 2751
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“曾经是。”叶观澜说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2753,
          "end": 2753
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "无脸的人从窗后伸出手，手腕上都缠着黑色铜丝。他们没有说话，只用指尖敲击窗框。三下之后，街尽头的拱门缓缓打开。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2755,
          "end": 2755
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门后出现一名僧人。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2757,
          "end": 2757
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "僧人穿灰衣，手里捧着一面无相铜镜。镜面没有倒影，只有一层缓慢流动的雾。他向叶观澜点头：“归墟盟的人，也开始带钥匙了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2759,
          "end": 2759
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“无相寺的慧闻？”叶观澜问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2761,
          "end": 2761
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“名字不重要。”僧人看向陆照临，“重要的是他还能记住多久。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2763,
          "end": 2763
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第二枚残印。”叶观澜伸手。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2789,
          "end": 2789
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临没有立刻交出。他蹲下观察石片周围，发现裂缝边缘刻着许多极细的名字。其中三个已经被削平，剩下的字迹却与旧档裁口一模一样。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2791,
          "end": 2791
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这座城封存时，有人还活着。”他说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2793,
          "end": 2793
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻看他：“活着不等于被允许记住。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2795,
          "end": 2795
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离捡起一块碎石，轻轻刮过裂缝。石屑下面露出一个完整的“顾”字，后面却被人用刀刃切断。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2797,
          "end": 2797
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她的呼吸变得急促。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2799,
          "end": 2799
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我叔父来过这里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2801,
          "end": 2801
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他不是来修城的。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2803,
          "end": 2803
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那他来做什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2805,
          "end": 2805
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“把一盏灯送进城心。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2807,
          "end": 2807
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临想起无灯镇守灯人的话：第二盏灯照活人。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2809,
          "end": 2809
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“灯现在在哪里？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2811,
          "end": 2811
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻指向青灯下的拱门：“还在城心。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2813,
          "end": 2813
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第三盏呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2815,
          "end": 2815
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第三盏从未进入这座城。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2817,
          "end": 2817
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜看向陆照临：“所以你父亲送的不是第三盏。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2819,
          "end": 2819
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临没有回答。掌心残印与裂缝中的石片互相吸引，青光在两者之间拉出一条细线。线的尽头指向城心深处，却被一扇黑铁门截断。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2821,
          "end": 2821
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "一次。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-073",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2839,
          "end": 2839
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这里写着三人。”她说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2948,
          "end": 2948
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你叔父是其中之一？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2950,
          "end": 2950
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我不知道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2952,
          "end": 2952
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她把清单递给他。清单最后一行注明：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2954,
          "end": 2954
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封存完成后，所有经手人不得保留原名，不得返回人间。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2956,
          "end": 2956
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临抬头：“这就是无灯镇说的没有名字的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2958,
          "end": 2958
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻不知何时走到他们身后：“不是失去名字，是名字被拿去填补灵脉。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2960,
          "end": 2960
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“名字还能填补灵脉？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2962,
          "end": 2962
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“太虚遗脉不认血肉，只认被世界记住的东西。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2964,
          "end": 2964
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所以你们把人的名字给了它？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2966,
          "end": 2966
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“当时只有这个办法。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2968,
          "end": 2968
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁决定的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2970,
          "end": 2970
        }
      }
    ],
